09-09 08:02:56.775 I/adbd    (10663):     values=$(awk '
09-09 08:02:56.775 I/adbd    (10663):       BEGIN { h=rss=anon=file=swap=cpus="" }
09-09 08:02:56.775 I/adbd    (10663):       $1 == "VmHWM:" {h=$2}
09-09 08:02:56.775 I/adbd    (10663):       $1 == "VmRSS:" {rss=$2}
